<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<model version="NetLogo 7.0.4" snapToGrid="true">
  <code><![CDATA[;; Autonomous mall interactions with user-controlled values, 27 October 2026.
;; One tick = one second; one patch ~= one metre. No recovery/death phase.
breed [viruses virus]
breed [customers customer]
breed [securities security]
breed [staffs staff-member]
breed [stores store]

turtles-own [
  is_infected is_wearing_mask body_temperature in_shop is_moving
  target_destination current_store assigned_store test_result tested_at
  blocked_by escort_guard escort_target finished_shopping
  pending_action action_target route route_goal last_action
  attended_by next_interaction action_progress_at action_deadline leaving_without_purchase
]
viruses-own [host phase transmission_rate transmission_radius
  transmission_success_percentage_threshold mask_reduction_factor
  incubation_timer infected_at contagious_at next_check]
securities-own [enforcement_radius current_task screening_target]
stores-own [store_name store_capacity store_capacity_limit entrance]
patches-own [walkable zone route_mark route_parent danger_radius]
globals [
  exit_patch entrance_patch bathroom_patch search_number ready?
  total_infections completed_shopping normal_departures
  escorted_departures entry_refusals failed_avoidance
  virus-settings walking-speed initial-case-count
  customer-target arrival-mask-percent customer-arrivals
]


to setup
  clear-all
  ;; Sliders choose the starting values. Keep them fixed for this run.
  set walking-speed movement-speed
  set virus-settings (list transmission-interval radius-setting
    (base-transmission-percent / 100) (mask-reduction-percent / 100)
    (incubation-minutes * 60))
  set initial-infected min list initial-infected customer-population
  set staff-population min list staff-population (4 * initial-store-capacity)
  set initial-case-count initial-infected
  set customer-target customer-population
  set arrival-mask-percent customer-mask-percent
  resize-world -16 16 -16 16
  set-topology false false
  set ready? false
  reset-ticks
  ask patches [
    set walkable (abs pxcor < 16 and abs pycor < 16)
    set zone nobody set route_parent nobody set danger_radius 0
    set pcolor ifelse-value walkable [9] [1]
  ]
  set exit_patch patch 0 -15
  set entrance_patch patch 2 -15
  set bathroom_patch patch 0 14
  ask exit_patch [set pcolor red set plabel "EXIT" set plabel-color white]
  ask entrance_patch [set pcolor green set plabel "ENTRY" set plabel-color white]
  ask bathroom_patch [set pcolor violet set plabel "BATHROOM" set plabel-color white]
  (foreach ["Store A" "Store B" "Food Court" "Front Desk"] [-9 9 -9 9] [9 9 -9 -9]
    [ [nm sx sy] ->
      create-stores 1 [
        setxy sx sy set store_name nm set label nm set label-color white
        set shape "house" set size 1.5 set color 105
        set store_capacity_limit initial-store-capacity set store_capacity 0
        set entrance patch sx (sy - 4 * ifelse-value (sy > 0) [1] [-1])
        let owner self
        ask patches with [abs (pxcor - sx) <= 4 and abs (pycor - sy) <= 4] [
          ifelse abs (pxcor - sx) = 4 or abs (pycor - sy) = 4
            [set walkable false set pcolor 1]
            [set walkable true set zone owner set pcolor 103]
        ]
        ask entrance [set walkable true set pcolor 47]
      ]
    ])
  set-default-shape customers "person"
  set-default-shape securities "person"
  set-default-shape staffs "person"
  set-default-shape viruses "bug"
  let store-list sort stores
  let staff-index 0
  repeat staff-population [
    let s item (staff-index mod length store-list) store-list
    create-staffs 1 [initialize-human set assigned_store s move-to s sync-location]
    set staff-index staff-index + 1
  ]
  create-securities security-population [
    initialize-human set enforcement_radius enforcement-radius-setting
    set current_task "Patrolling" move-to one-of corridor-patches sync-location
  ]
  create-customers customer-population [
    initialize-human move-to one-of corridor-patches sync-location
  ]
  ask n-of initial-case-count customers [acquire-infection true nobody]
  (foreach (list customers securities staffs)
    (list customer-mask-percent security-mask-percent staff-mask-percent)
    [[people percent] ->
      ask n-of (ceiling (count people * percent / 100)) people [set is_wearing_mask true]
    ])
  set ready? true
  refresh-danger refresh-display
end


to initialize-human
  set is_infected false set is_wearing_mask false set body_temperature 36.5
  set in_shop false set is_moving false set current_store nobody set assigned_store nobody
  set target_destination nobody set test_result "Untested" set tested_at -1
  set blocked_by nobody set escort_guard nobody set escort_target nobody
  set finished_shopping false set pending_action "" set action_target nobody
  set route [] set route_goal nobody set last_action "Setup" set size 0.9
  set attended_by nobody set next_interaction 0 set action_progress_at 0
  set action_deadline 0 set leaving_without_purchase false
  if breed = securities [set screening_target nobody]
end

to-report humans
  report (turtle-set customers securities staffs)
end

to-report corridor-patches
  report patches with [walkable and zone = nobody and self != exit_patch and self != entrance_patch and self != bathroom_patch]
end

to-report breed-name
  if breed = customers [report "Customer"]
  if breed = staffs [report "Staff"]
  if breed = securities [report "Security"]
  report "Store"
end


to go
  if not ready? [stop]
  refresh-danger
  ask humans [set is_moving false]
  ask securities [security-decisions]
  ask staffs [staff-decisions]
  ask customers [customer-conversations]
  ask humans [human-step]
  replenish-customers
  ;; Transmit after movements. Existing viruses alone are processed this tick.
  ask viruses [virus-step]
  refresh-display
  tick
  ;; Displayed time and incubation clocks agree at the end of each second.
  ask viruses with [phase = "Incubating"] [
    set incubation_timer max list 0 (contagious_at - ticks)
    if incubation_timer = 0 [
      set phase "Contagious"
    ]
  ]
end

to replenish-customers
  ;; Admit one new shopper per simulated second while below the setup target.
  ;; Departed agents stay departed; arrivals have new identities and histories.
  if count customers >= customer-target [stop]
  create-customers 1 [
    initialize-human
    move-to entrance_patch
    sync-location
    set is_wearing_mask (random-float 100 < arrival-mask-percent)
    set last_action "Arrive"
    choose-destination
    set customer-arrivals customer-arrivals + 1
  ]
end

to security-decisions
  if attended_by != nobody or blocked_by != nobody or escort_guard != nobody or escort_target != nobody [stop]
  if screening_target != nobody and pending_action != "" [
    ;; Pass an approach to an idle guard who is closer to the person.
    let recipient screening_target let sender self
    let helpers securities with [self != sender and available? and attended_by = nobody and
      distance recipient <= enforcement_radius and distance recipient + 1 < [distance recipient] of sender]
    if any? helpers [
      let helper min-one-of helpers [distance recipient]
      delegate-action who [who] of helper
    ]
    stop
  ]
  if not available? or ticks < next_interaction [stop]
  let guard-self self
  let people humans with [self != guard-self and available? and attended_by = nobody and ticks >= next_interaction and
    distance guard-self <= [enforcement_radius] of guard-self and
    (breed != securities or distance guard-self <= 1) and
    (test_result = "Positive" or not is_wearing_mask or tested_at < 0 or ticks - tested_at >= 300)]
  if not any? people [stop]
  let recipient min-one-of people [distance guard-self]
  set screening_target recipient
  ask recipient [set attended_by guard-self]
  request-action who [who] of recipient "Question"
end

to staff-decisions
  if not available? or attended_by != nobody or assigned_store = nobody [stop]
  let seller self
  let visitors customers with [current_store = [assigned_store] of seller and
    available? and attended_by = nobody]
  let unmasked visitors with [not is_wearing_mask]
  if any? unmasked [
    let recipient min-one-of unmasked [distance seller]
    ask recipient [set attended_by seller]
    request-action who [who] of recipient "Question"
    stop
  ]
  if ticks >= next_interaction and any? visitors in-radius 1 [
    let recipient one-of visitors in-radius 1
    ask recipient [set attended_by seller]
    request-action who [who] of recipient "Talk"
  ]
end

to customer-conversations
  if not available? or attended_by != nobody or in_shop or ticks < next_interaction [stop]
  let speaker self
  let peers other customers in-radius 1 with [available? and attended_by = nobody and ticks >= next_interaction]
  if any? peers [
    let peer one-of peers
    set last_action "Talk" set next_interaction ticks + 15
    ask peer [set last_action "Talk" set next_interaction ticks + 15]
  ]
end

to acquire-infection [initial? source]
  if is_infected [stop]
  set is_infected true
  let person self
  set total_infections total_infections + 1
  hatch-viruses 1 [
    set host person set size 0.3 hide-turtle
    set transmission_rate item 0 virus-settings
    set transmission_radius item 1 virus-settings
    set transmission_success_percentage_threshold item 2 virus-settings
    set mask_reduction_factor item 3 virus-settings
    set infected_at ticks
    set incubation_timer ifelse-value initial? [0] [item 4 virus-settings]
    set contagious_at ticks + incubation_timer
    set phase ifelse-value initial? ["Contagious"] ["Incubating"]
    set next_check contagious_at + transmission_rate
    set route [] set route_goal nobody
  ]
end

to virus-step
  if host = nobody [die]
  move-to host
  if phase = "Incubating" [
    set incubation_timer max list 0 (contagious_at - ticks)
    if incubation_timer = 0 [
      set phase "Contagious"
    ]
  ]
  if phase = "Contagious" and ticks >= next_check [
    set next_check ticks + transmission_rate
    let source host let probability transmission_success_percentage_threshold
    let reduction mask_reduction_factor
    let recipients humans with [not is_infected and distance source <= [transmission_radius] of myself]
    foreach sort recipients [recipient ->
      let effective probability
      if [is_wearing_mask] of source or [is_wearing_mask] of recipient
        [set effective probability * (1 - reduction)]
      if not [is_infected] of recipient and random-float 1 < effective
        [ask recipient [acquire-infection false source]]
    ]
  ]
end

to refresh-danger
  ask patches [set danger_radius 0]
  ask viruses with [phase = "Contagious"] [
    if host != nobody and [test_result] of host = "Positive" [
      let source host let radius transmission_radius
      ask patches with [distance source <= radius] [set danger_radius danger_radius + 1]
    ]
  ]
end

to human-step
  if escort_guard != nobody [stop] ;; paired movement is performed by the escorting guard
  if escort_target != nobody [escort-step stop]
  if blocked_by != nobody [stop]
  if pending_action != "" [interaction-step stop]
  if breed = customers and (finished_shopping or leaving_without_purchase) [travel exit_patch false if distance exit_patch < 0.05 [depart "Normal"] stop]
  if breed = staffs [
    if assigned_store != nobody and current_store = assigned_store [
      if any? customers with [current_store = [assigned_store] of myself and not finished_shopping] [stop]
      if target_destination = nobody or distance target_destination < 0.05 [
        set target_destination one-of patches with [zone = [assigned_store] of myself]
      ]
      travel target_destination false
    ]
    stop
  ]
  if breed = customers and in_shop [
    if attended_by != nobody [stop]
    let s current_store
    ;; Leave without counting a purchase if this store has no assigned staff.
    if not any? staffs with [assigned_store = s] [
      set leaving_without_purchase true set target_destination exit_patch
      set route [] set route_goal nobody stop
    ]
    let sellers staffs with [assigned_store = s and current_store = s and available? and attended_by = nobody]
    if any? sellers [
      let seller min-one-of sellers [distance myself]
      ifelse distance seller <= 1 [complete-purchase who] [travel [patch-here] of seller false]
    ]
    stop
  ]
  if target_destination = nobody [choose-destination]
  if target_destination = nobody [stop]
  let goal destination-patch target_destination
  if goal = nobody [set target_destination nobody stop]
  travel goal false
  if goal != nobody and distance goal < 0.05 [
    if breed = securities or target_destination = bathroom_patch [
      set target_destination nobody set route []
    ]
  ]
end

to choose-destination
  if breed = staffs [
    set target_destination one-of patches with [zone = [assigned_store] of myself]
    set route [] set route_goal nobody
    stop
  ]
  if breed = securities [
    set target_destination one-of corridor-patches
    set route [] set route_goal nobody
    stop
  ]
  let eligible shopping-stores
  if not any? staffs [
    set leaving_without_purchase true set target_destination exit_patch
    set route [] set route_goal nobody stop
  ]
  ;; Each eligible named destination has one equal slot, including Bathroom.
  set target_destination one-of sentence (sort eligible) (list bathroom_patch)
  set route [] set route_goal nobody
end

to-report shopping-stores
  report stores with [store_capacity < store_capacity_limit and
    any? staffs with [assigned_store = myself]]
end

to-report destination-patch [destination]
  if destination = nobody [report nobody]
  if is-patch? destination [report destination]
  if is-turtle? destination [report [patch-here] of destination]
  report nobody
end

to sync-location
  set current_store [zone] of patch-here
  set in_shop (current_store != nobody)
  ask stores [set store_capacity count customers with [current_store = myself]]
end

;; Routes use actual corridors and doorways. Admissions are serial because ASK
;; executes one human at a time and sync-location runs immediately after a step.
to travel [goal permit-exposure?]
  if goal = nobody or distance goal < 0.05 [stop]
  if route_goal != goal or empty? route [
    set route_goal goal
    set route find-route goal (not permit-exposure?)
    if empty? route and not permit-exposure? [
      set route find-route goal false
      if not empty? route [
        set failed_avoidance failed_avoidance + 1
      ]
    ]
  ]
  if empty? route [stop]
  ;; Replan when a known positive host has moved into the planned next cell.
  if not permit-exposure? and [danger_radius] of first route > 0 and [danger_radius] of patch-here = 0 [
    let safe-route find-route goal true
    ifelse empty? safe-route [
      set failed_avoidance failed_avoidance + 1
    ] [set route safe-route]
  ]
  ;; Spend the selected movement budget across cell centres each second.
  let budget walking-speed
  while [budget > 0.000001 and not empty? route] [
    let next-cell first route
    let stride min list budget (distance next-cell)
    ifelse stride <= 0.000001 [set route but-first route] [
      face next-cell
      let landing patch-at-heading-and-distance heading stride
      if landing = nobody [set route [] stop]
      if not [walkable] of landing [set route [] stop]
      if breed = staffs and [zone] of landing != assigned_store [set route [] stop]
      let entering [zone] of landing
      if breed = customers and entering != nobody and entering != current_store [
        if [store_capacity] of entering >= [store_capacity_limit] of entering [
          refuse-entry entering set route [] set route_goal nobody stop
        ]
      ]
      fd stride
      set budget budget - stride
      set is_moving true set last_action "Move"
      sync-location
      if distance next-cell < 0.000001 [set route but-first route]
    ]
  ]
end

to refuse-entry [s]
  set last_action "Entry Refused"
  set entry_refusals entry_refusals + 1
  let attendant one-of staffs with [assigned_store = s and blocked_by = nobody and escort_guard = nobody]
  if attendant != nobody [ask attendant [set last_action "Block"]]
  if breed = customers and pending_action = "" and not finished_shopping [
    let alternatives shopping-stores with [self != s]
    set target_destination ifelse-value any? alternatives [one-of alternatives] [nobody]
  ]
end

to-report find-route [goal avoid?]
  if goal = patch-here [report (list goal)]
  set search_number search_number + 1
  let mark search_number let origin patch-here let person self
  let allowed-store [zone] of goal
  let origin-store current_store
  let initially-unsafe [danger_radius] of origin > 0
  ask origin [set route_mark mark set route_parent nobody]
  let queue (list origin) let cursor 0 let found? false
  while [cursor < length queue and not found?] [
    let cell item cursor queue set cursor cursor + 1
    let candidates sort [neighbors4] of cell
    foreach candidates [p ->
      if [route_mark] of p != mark and [walkable] of p [
        let store-ok? ([zone] of p = nobody or [zone] of p = origin-store or [zone] of p = allowed-store)
        if [breed] of person = staffs [
          set store-ok? ([zone] of p = [assigned_store] of person)
        ]
        let safe? (not avoid? or [danger_radius] of p = 0)
        ;; Permit an already exposed person to step out without moving deeper in.
        if initially-unsafe and [danger_radius] of p <= [danger_radius] of cell [set safe? true]
        if store-ok? and safe? [
          ask p [set route_mark mark set route_parent cell]
          set queue lput p queue
          if p = goal [set found? true]
        ]
      ]
    ]
  ]
  if not found? [report []]
  let path [] let cell goal
  while [cell != origin] [set path fput cell path set cell [route_parent] of cell]
  report path
end

to request-action [actor-number target-number action-name]
  let actor turtle actor-number let recipient turtle target-number
  if actor = nobody or recipient = nobody [stop]
  if not member? actor sort humans or not member? recipient sort humans or actor = recipient
    [stop]
  let allowed ["Talk"]
  if [breed] of actor = securities [set allowed ["Talk" "Question" "Block" "Test" "Supply Mask" "Escort" "Release"]]
  if [breed] of actor = staffs [set allowed ["Talk" "Question" "Supply Mask"]]
  if not member? action-name allowed [stop]
  if action-name = "Escort" and [breed] of recipient != customers
    [stop]
  if not [available?] of actor [stop]
  if [escort_guard] of recipient != nobody or [escort_target] of recipient != nobody
    [stop]
  if [breed] of actor = securities and [distance recipient] of actor > [enforcement_radius] of actor
    [stop]
  if [breed] of actor = staffs and [current_store] of recipient != [assigned_store] of actor
    [stop]
  ask actor [
    set pending_action action-name set action_target recipient set route [] set route_goal nobody
    set action_progress_at ticks
    ;; Bound the whole interaction, including movement and guard delegation.
    set action_deadline ticks + max list 120 (ceiling (120 / walking-speed))
    if breed = securities [set current_task ifelse-value (action-name = "Test") ["Testing"] ["Enforcing"]]
  ]
end

to-report available?
  report blocked_by = nobody and escort_guard = nobody and escort_target = nobody and pending_action = "" and not finished_shopping and not leaving_without_purchase
end

to interaction-step
  if action_target = nobody [
    resume-role stop
  ]
  let recipient action_target
  if [escort_guard] of recipient != nobody or [escort_target] of recipient != nobody [
    resume-role stop
  ]
  if ticks >= action_deadline [
    ask recipient [set next_interaction ticks + 15]
    resume-role stop
  ]
  let contact-allowed? (breed = securities and member? pending_action ["Test" "Supply Mask" "Escort"])
  if distance recipient > 1 or current_store != [current_store] of recipient [
    travel [patch-here] of recipient contact-allowed?
    if is_moving [set action_progress_at ticks]
    if ticks - action_progress_at >= 30 [
      ask recipient [set next_interaction ticks + 15]
      resume-role
      stop
    ]
  ]
  if distance recipient > 1 or current_store != [current_store] of recipient [stop]
  let act pending_action
  set last_action act
  if act = "Test" [
    ask recipient [set test_result ifelse-value is_infected ["Positive"] ["Negative"] set tested_at ticks]
  ]
  if act = "Supply Mask" [
    ask recipient [set is_wearing_mask true]
  ]
  if act = "Block" [
    ask recipient [
      set blocked_by myself set is_moving false
      set pending_action "" set action_target nobody set route []
    ]
    queue-screening-step "Test"
    stop
  ]
  if act = "Question" [
    if breed = securities [queue-screening-step "Block" stop]
    if breed = staffs and not [is_wearing_mask] of recipient [
      set pending_action "Supply Mask" stop
    ]
  ]
  if breed = securities and member? act ["Test" "Supply Mask"] [
    if act = "Test" and not [is_wearing_mask] of recipient [queue-screening-step "Supply Mask" stop]
    queue-screening-step (ifelse-value ([test_result] of recipient = "Positive" and [breed] of recipient = customers) ["Escort"] ["Release"])
    stop
  ]
  if act = "Release" [
    ask recipient [set blocked_by nobody set attended_by nobody]
  ]
  if act = "Escort" [
    if [breed] of recipient != customers [resume-role stop]
    set escort_target recipient
    ask recipient [
      set escort_guard myself set blocked_by nobody set pending_action ""
      set action_target nobody set target_destination exit_patch set route []
    ]
    set pending_action "" set action_target nobody set target_destination exit_patch set route []
    set current_task "Enforcing" stop
  ]
  resume-role
end

to queue-screening-step [act]
  set pending_action act
  set action_progress_at ticks
  set current_task ifelse-value (act = "Test") ["Testing"] ["Enforcing"]
end

to resume-role
  let actor self
  ask humans with [attended_by = actor] [
    set attended_by nobody
    if blocked_by = actor [set blocked_by nobody]
  ]
  set pending_action "" set action_target nobody set route [] set route_goal nobody
  set target_destination nobody set next_interaction ticks + 15
  if breed = securities [set current_task "Patrolling" set screening_target nobody]
end

to escort-step
  let companion escort_target
  if companion = nobody [resume-role stop]
  if [breed] of companion != customers [
    ask companion [set escort_guard nobody set blocked_by nobody]
    set escort_target nobody resume-role stop
  ]
  ;; Both approach each waypoint together; no remote teleport to exit.
  if distance companion > 1 [travel [patch-here] of companion true stop]
  travel exit_patch true
  let guard-self self
  ask companion [travel [patch-here] of guard-self true]
  if distance exit_patch < 0.05 and [distance exit_patch] of companion < 0.05 [
    ask companion [depart "Escorted"]
    set escort_target nobody resume-role
  ]
end

to depart [reason]
  ;; Staff and security remain in the mall for the entire run.
  if breed != customers [stop]
  ifelse reason = "Escorted" [set escorted_departures escorted_departures + 1]
    [set normal_departures normal_departures + 1]
  let person self
  ask viruses with [host = person] [die]
  ask humans with [blocked_by = person] [set blocked_by nobody]
  ask humans with [attended_by = person] [set attended_by nobody]
  let old-store current_store
  if old-store != nobody [ask old-store [set store_capacity store_capacity - 1]]
  die
end

to complete-purchase [customer-number]
  let buyer turtle customer-number
  if buyer = nobody [stop]
  if [breed] of buyer != customers [stop]
  let s [current_store] of buyer
  if s = nobody [stop]
  if not [available?] of buyer or [attended_by] of buyer != nobody
    [stop]
  let sellers staffs with [assigned_store = s and current_store = s and available? and
    attended_by = nobody and distance buyer <= 1]
  if not any? sellers [stop]
  let seller min-one-of sellers [distance buyer]
  ask buyer [set finished_shopping true set last_action "Buy" set target_destination exit_patch set route []]
  ask seller [set last_action "Sell"]
  set completed_shopping completed_shopping + 1
end

to delegate-action [from-number to-number]
  let sender turtle from-number let receiver turtle to-number
  if sender = nobody or receiver = nobody [stop]
  if not is-security? sender or not is-security? receiver or sender = receiver
    [stop]
  if [pending_action] of sender = "" or not [available?] of receiver
    [stop]
  let recipient [action_target] of sender let act [pending_action] of sender
  if recipient = nobody or recipient = receiver
    [stop]
  if [distance recipient] of receiver > [enforcement_radius] of receiver
    [stop]
  ask receiver [set pending_action act set action_target recipient
    set action_progress_at [action_progress_at] of sender
    set action_deadline [action_deadline] of sender
    set screening_target recipient
    set current_task [current_task] of sender set route [] set route_goal nobody]
  ask recipient [
    set attended_by receiver
    if blocked_by = sender [set blocked_by receiver]
  ]
  ask sender [resume-role]
end



to-report new-infections
  report max list 0 (total_infections - initial-case-count)
end

to refresh-display
  ask humans [
    ;; Role colors apply to healthy people; infection overrides every role.
    if breed = customers [set color green]
    if breed = securities [set color cyan]
    if breed = staffs [set color yellow]
    if is_infected [set color red]
    set label ifelse-value is_wearing_mask ["M"] [""]
    set label-color ifelse-value in_shop [white] [black]
  ]
  ask stores [
    ;; Occupancy counts customers only; keep doorway labels compact.
    set label (word store_name " " store_capacity "/" store_capacity_limit)
    set color 105
    let s self
    ask patches with [zone = s] [set pcolor 103]
  ]
end

]]></code>
  <widgets>
    <view x="290" wrappingAllowedX="false" y="55" frameRate="30.0" minPycor="-16" height="434" showTickCounter="true" patchSize="13.0" fontSize="10" wrappingAllowedY="false" width="434" tickCounterLabel="seconds" maxPycor="16" updateMode="1" maxPxcor="16" minPxcor="-16"></view>
    <button x="10" y="10" height="35" disableUntilTicks="false" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="135" display="Setup">setup</button>
    <button x="155" y="10" height="35" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="true" kind="Observer" width="135" display="Go / Stop">go</button>
    <button x="300" y="10" height="35" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="135" display="One second">go</button>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="380" max="10" width="270" display="initial-store-capacity" height="50" min="5" direction="Horizontal" default="5.0" variable="initial-store-capacity" units="customers"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="55" max="200" width="270" display="customer-population" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="30.0" variable="customer-population"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="100" max="30" width="270" display="security-population" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="3.0" variable="security-population"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="145" max="4 * initial-store-capacity" width="270" display="staff-population" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="4.0" variable="staff-population"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="190" max="customer-population" width="270" display="initial-infected" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="3.0" variable="initial-infected"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="250" max="100" width="270" display="customer-mask-percent" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="50.0" variable="customer-mask-percent" units="%"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="295" max="100" width="270" display="security-mask-percent" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="50.0" variable="security-mask-percent" units="%"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="340" max="100" width="270" display="staff-mask-percent" height="50" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="50.0" variable="staff-mask-percent" units="%"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="55" max="10" width="270" display="transmission-interval" height="50" min="5" direction="Horizontal" default="7.0" variable="transmission-interval" units="sec"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="0.5" y="100" max="6" width="270" display="radius-setting" height="50" min="2" direction="Horizontal" default="4.0" variable="radius-setting" units="m"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="145" max="80" width="270" display="base-transmission-percent" height="50" min="50" direction="Horizontal" default="65.0" variable="base-transmission-percent" units="%"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="190" max="40" width="270" display="mask-reduction-percent" height="50" min="30" direction="Horizontal" default="35.0" variable="mask-reduction-percent" units="%"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="235" max="60" width="270" display="incubation-minutes" height="50" min="30" direction="Horizontal" default="45.0" variable="incubation-minutes" units="min"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="0.1" y="290" max="1" width="270" display="movement-speed" height="50" min="0.1" direction="Horizontal" default="0.4" variable="movement-speed" units="m/sec"></slider>
    <slider x="740" step="1" y="335" max="30" width="270" display="enforcement-radius-setting" height="50" min="10" direction="Horizontal" default="20.0" variable="enforcement-radius-setting" units="m"></slider>
    <monitor x="10" precision="0" y="400" height="60" fontSize="10" width="125" display="Customers present">count customers</monitor>
    <monitor x="145" precision="0" y="400" height="60" fontSize="10" width="125" display="New infections">new-infections</monitor>
    <monitor x="10" precision="0" y="450" height="60" fontSize="10" width="125" display="Purchases">completed_shopping</monitor>
    <monitor x="145" precision="0" y="450" height="60" fontSize="10" width="125" display="Departures">normal_departures + escorted_departures</monitor>
    <monitor x="740" precision="0" y="435" height="60" fontSize="10" width="270" display="New customer arrivals">customer-arrivals</monitor>
    <plot x="10" autoPlotX="true" yMax="35.0" autoPlotY="true" yAxis="New cases" y="550" xMin="0.0" height="150" legend="false" xMax="60.0" yMin="0.0" width="1000" xAxis="Seconds" display="New infections">
      <setup></setup>
      <update></update>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="New infections" color="-2674135" legend="false">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot new-infections</update>
      </pen>
    </plot>
  </widgets>
  <info>## UPDATED BEHAVIOR — 28 October 2026

Open this model, choose slider settings, and press Setup before Go. Sliders are captured at Setup. One tick is one simulated second. Role colors and infection colors remain; the color-key and last-action panels were removed.

Customers choose staffed stores with available customer capacity. Temporarily busy staff remain eligible for later service. Customers already in a store with no assigned staff leave without a purchase. If there are no staff anywhere, customers leave without a purchase; replacement arrivals still maintain the chosen population. These ordinary departures increase the departure counter but not purchases.

Purchases require an available, unreserved staff member in the same shop within one metre. The nearest eligible staff member performs the sale.

An interaction ends after 30 seconds without movement or an absolute deadline of max(120, ceiling(120 / movement-speed)) simulated seconds. The speed-scaled deadline permits slow travel, is preserved through delegation and screening steps, and releases reservations and blocks on expiry. Both parties receive the existing 15-second cooldown. This deadline applies before escorting; paired escorts keep their existing movement.

Event and test histories and status-message logging have been removed. Current per-agent state (including test results and action state), aggregate counters, and the infection plot remain. There is no recovery/death phase. Staff remain in assigned stores and guards remain in the mall. Only customers count toward store capacity.

This named model is standalone. The separate Viral Contagion.nlogox builder and source do not generate this variant.
</info>
